Title: What They Called Recovery
Credit: Animated feature screenplay — source-developed working scene
Author: Christopher Kokkinos
Draft date: 2026-10-10
Status: Independent screenplay development under DEC-0019; refinements during production

EXT. FREIGHT STOP - THURSDAY - BEFORE SUNRISE

The second car waits beyond the barrier. In the cup holder, Mac's transmitter pulses again. Zoe reads a route card on a detached refrigerated trailer.

ZOE
Whoever follows that follows the driver. What if they stop him?

ELIAS
There is risk.

ZOE
To somebody who knows nothing about us.

ELIAS
Yes.

She keeps the tracker in her hand. He waits.

ZOE
Use the detached trailer. Not a cab. Nothing that makes the driver look involved.

ELIAS
I can reduce the risk. I can't make it risk-free.

She hands it back. He fixes it to the trailer's rear structure. From the public road they watch a tractor unit collect it and head east. Only then does Elias turn west.

INT./EXT. FARMHOUSE - THURSDAY - DAY

A disused dairy yard. Poplars screen a road much closer than at the cottage. Elias checks water, both staircases and the drainage ditch before showing Zoe her bedroom. He gives her the second set of keys.

FRIDAY: rain drips onto the backpack. Elias finds Zoe upstairs.

ELIAS
Your bag's getting wet.

ZOE
You moved it?

ELIAS
No. It's yours.

She moves it herself. Later, her aligned zip pulls remain exactly as she left them.

SATURDAY: a road atlas and dried beans on the kitchen table. Zoe marks possible eastern depots.

ELIAS
Whoever is searching has choices.

She places one bean at the cottage, one east, one in the margin.

ZOE
One follows the signal. One stays where it disappeared. One follows who you used to be.

Elias studies the third bean.

ZOE
You keep paying for things you say you left behind.

ELIAS
The records search may be the dangerous one.

SUNDAY: Zoe struggles to mend the backpack strap.

ELIAS
May I?

She offers the loose end without releasing the bag. He takes only that end. His stitches are small and even.

ZOE
Who taught you?

ELIAS
Someone who got tired of repairing my work.

ZOE
Still in your life?

ELIAS
No.

She tests the strap. Later she leaves the backpack beneath the table. Elias does not touch it.

MONDAY EVENING: the beans return to the atlas.

ZOE
They've had four days. So they took it.

ELIAS
I think so.

ZOE
You said that like you knew.

ELIAS
I shouldn't have.

He reduces the claim: no repeated vehicle or approach here; the diversion probably worked. Zoe taps the records-search bean.

ZOE
And now?

ELIAS
More interested. Whoever Mac sent is good.

ZOE
So are we.

He leaves the answer standing.
